WEBVTT

01:26.760 --> 01:29.730
[Glory]

01:30.870 --> 01:33.030
[Episode 4]

01:45.150 --> 01:46.520
Wen Can acted flirtatious

01:46.520 --> 01:48.050
and reckless in front of me.

01:48.280 --> 01:49.539
Did you teach him that?

01:49.650 --> 01:50.350
What?

01:50.920 --> 01:53.039
Wen Can has been pampered since childhood.

01:53.039 --> 01:55.100
He's simple-minded and easy to fool.

01:55.160 --> 01:56.920
You'd better hope I don't find out

01:56.920 --> 01:57.680
that someone is using him

01:57.680 --> 01:59.140
for underhanded schemes.

01:59.280 --> 01:59.940
Otherwise,

02:00.400 --> 02:02.200
I won't let them get away with it.

02:10.180 --> 02:10.970
Miss Rong,

02:12.000 --> 02:13.260
did you know me before?

02:15.520 --> 02:16.980
What are you trying to say?

02:17.840 --> 02:19.640
Miss Rong, if you didn't know me,

02:20.430 --> 02:21.240
why did you

02:21.240 --> 02:22.630
judge me with such malice?

02:22.630 --> 02:23.120
You...

02:24.090 --> 02:25.120
How dare you!

02:31.440 --> 02:32.500
What kind of person

02:33.310 --> 02:34.590
do you think you are?

02:37.360 --> 02:38.120
I don't know.

02:40.150 --> 02:41.550
I don't remember my past.

02:42.150 --> 02:43.950
I don't remember who I am either.

02:46.960 --> 02:47.750
Miss Rong,

02:47.750 --> 02:49.350
if you really don't trust me,

02:49.400 --> 02:50.800
why not transfer me from Mr. Wen's side

02:50.800 --> 02:51.660
to Qilan Garden

02:52.000 --> 02:53.730
so that you can keep an eye on me?

02:58.910 --> 02:59.560
Miss Rong.

03:03.360 --> 03:04.160
You may go now.

03:16.520 --> 03:17.920
Don't you like this whip?

03:22.360 --> 03:23.040
I said

03:23.800 --> 03:25.730
I wouldn't accept gifts this time.

03:31.000 --> 03:31.750
This whip

03:32.520 --> 03:34.380
is very handy for hitting people.

03:35.320 --> 03:36.160
Mr. He.

03:37.240 --> 03:39.100
Our Rong family has our own rules.

03:39.630 --> 03:41.090
You cutting out his tongue

03:41.280 --> 03:42.310
was going too far.

03:43.030 --> 03:43.870
Miss Rong.

03:44.800 --> 03:46.130
That idiot tea merchant

03:46.430 --> 03:48.680
was planning revenge
against you last night.

03:48.680 --> 03:50.030
You ought to thank me.

03:50.970 --> 03:52.300
Mind your own business.

03:56.550 --> 03:57.210
Step aside!

03:57.700 --> 03:59.700
You don't remember anything at all?

04:00.750 --> 04:01.280
What?

04:07.190 --> 04:08.030
Miss Rong,

04:09.350 --> 04:11.040
you're so cold-hearted.

04:23.510 --> 04:24.720
Why didn't I get a return gift?

04:24.720 --> 04:25.720
Shanbao clearly said

04:25.720 --> 04:26.920
everyone would get a return gift!

04:26.920 --> 04:29.040
Mr. Wen, Miss Rong said
you didn't send anything,

04:29.040 --> 04:31.070
so there was no need for a return gift.

04:31.070 --> 04:32.320
Who said I didn't send a gift?

04:32.320 --> 04:33.050
I clearly...

04:33.360 --> 04:33.870
I...

04:35.520 --> 04:36.390
You may go now.

04:43.150 --> 04:44.560
You go stand guard outside Qilan Garden

04:44.560 --> 04:45.390
and find out who Shanbao

04:45.390 --> 04:46.680
is having dinner with tonight.

04:46.680 --> 04:47.540
Unless it's me,

04:47.720 --> 04:49.390
don't let anyone in.

04:49.920 --> 04:50.720
Me?

04:51.360 --> 04:52.190
Stop others?

04:52.360 --> 04:53.480
Shanbao said you're very capable.

04:53.480 --> 04:54.240
You can definitely do it.

04:54.240 --> 04:54.830
Hurry up!

04:55.830 --> 04:56.480
Hurry up!

04:58.120 --> 04:58.630
Go now!

05:03.160 --> 05:03.830
Miss Rong,

05:03.950 --> 05:05.480
Steward Cheng came to ask

05:05.830 --> 05:08.090
who should be invited to join for dinner.

05:10.560 --> 05:11.420
Bai Yingsheng.

05:12.360 --> 05:12.870
Yes.

05:17.120 --> 05:18.050
Why are you here?

05:19.070 --> 05:20.360
Mr. Wen sent me here.

05:28.390 --> 05:29.720
Why did he send you here?

05:33.920 --> 05:34.830
Mr. Wen

05:35.159 --> 05:36.690
asked me to stand guard here

05:36.750 --> 05:38.190
to chase away other young masters

05:38.190 --> 05:39.320
who come for dinner.

05:39.950 --> 05:41.010
You can go back now.

05:41.159 --> 05:43.600
Miss Rong, you told me to go back,

05:44.240 --> 05:45.720
but Mr. Wen told me not to.

05:46.270 --> 05:47.190
This isn't the first time

05:47.190 --> 05:48.920
I've been caught in the middle.

05:48.920 --> 05:50.630
Miss Rong, please tell me exactly

05:50.630 --> 05:51.360
whose orders

05:51.750 --> 05:53.280
I should follow from now on.

05:57.680 --> 05:58.680
Follow my orders.

06:01.040 --> 06:01.600
Okay.

06:09.850 --> 06:11.580
Miss Rong, if you don't like it,

06:11.790 --> 06:14.120
you don't actually have to choose anyone.

06:22.310 --> 06:23.970
Sorry that I spoke out of turn.

06:23.990 --> 06:25.850
You didn't just speak out of turn.

06:26.110 --> 06:28.390
You eavesdropped
on your master's conversation.

06:28.390 --> 06:29.160
I dare not.

06:30.040 --> 06:30.950
I only overheard a little bit

06:30.950 --> 06:31.680
by accident.

06:33.070 --> 06:34.000
I just...

06:37.800 --> 06:39.800
I just feel sorry for you, Miss Rong.

07:07.510 --> 07:08.070
Mr. Bai,

07:08.600 --> 07:10.630
my young lady invites you to dinner.

07:14.680 --> 07:16.560
Very well. I'll be right there.

07:44.800 --> 07:45.920
I thought the dinner

07:45.920 --> 07:48.040
was supposed to be held at Qilan Garden.

07:48.040 --> 07:48.720
Mr. Bai,

07:51.240 --> 07:51.870
are you that eager

07:51.870 --> 07:53.600
to visit Shanbao's courtyard?

07:55.000 --> 07:56.730
Greetings, Fourth Young Lady.

08:00.600 --> 08:02.930
Please sit down. The food is getting cold.

08:05.390 --> 08:06.560
Was it the Fourth Young Lady

08:06.560 --> 08:08.290
who asked you to invite me here?

08:10.270 --> 08:10.830
What?

08:11.480 --> 08:12.630
Do you really think

08:12.830 --> 08:14.560
it was Shanbao who invited you?

08:20.920 --> 08:22.270
I kindly invited you to dinner.

08:22.270 --> 08:23.680
Why the long face?

08:24.630 --> 08:25.070
Do you think

08:25.070 --> 08:26.730
I'm inferior to Rong Shanbao?

08:27.840 --> 08:28.440
I dare not.

08:28.790 --> 08:30.630
Fourth Young Lady, you're so stunning

08:30.630 --> 08:32.150
that no one dares to look directly at you.

08:32.150 --> 08:33.000
But I came here specifically

08:33.000 --> 08:34.909
to compete for the position
as Miss Rong Shanbao's husband.

08:34.909 --> 08:36.120
So I dare not be wavering

08:36.120 --> 08:36.980
in my devotion.

08:37.360 --> 08:39.440
I have let down your kind intentions,
Fourth Young Lady.

08:39.440 --> 08:40.500
Please forgive me.

08:51.490 --> 08:52.230
I'm sorry.

08:58.840 --> 09:00.120
Did you hear that just now?

09:00.120 --> 09:01.480
I originally wanted you to see

09:01.480 --> 09:02.960
that idiot make a fool of himself.

09:02.960 --> 09:03.720
But in the end,

09:03.720 --> 09:05.320
I was the only one who got worked up!

09:05.320 --> 09:06.840
Yunyin, don't be angry.

09:07.240 --> 09:08.320
There's plenty of time ahead,

09:08.320 --> 09:09.780
so there's no need to rush.

09:10.370 --> 09:11.600
Whoever

09:12.270 --> 09:13.200
has crossed me

09:13.730 --> 09:14.780
will pay for it!

09:55.440 --> 09:56.040
Miss Rong,

09:56.320 --> 09:57.920
I got there a little too late.

09:58.130 --> 09:59.280
The Fourth Young Lady

09:59.280 --> 10:00.350
sent for him first.

10:01.030 --> 10:02.320
I wasn't sure what to do,

10:02.320 --> 10:04.320
so I came back to ask for your orders.

10:04.390 --> 10:05.200
Should we

10:06.240 --> 10:07.600
have him brought back?

10:09.550 --> 10:10.200
No need.

10:11.170 --> 10:12.300
Let her have her way.

10:13.840 --> 10:15.150
Yes, Miss Rong.

10:19.100 --> 10:21.560
Miss Rong,
shall we have the meal served now?

10:27.120 --> 10:28.120
Is he still there?

10:28.960 --> 10:30.620
He's still kneeling outside.

10:32.120 --> 10:33.180
Tell him to come in.

10:43.650 --> 10:44.910
Greetings, Miss Rong.

10:45.720 --> 10:46.270
Come in.

10:58.230 --> 10:59.890
Have you learned your lesson?

10:59.910 --> 11:02.370
From now on,
I will be prudent in word and deed

11:02.380 --> 11:04.240
and won't speak out of turn again.

11:04.440 --> 11:06.240
Do you resent me for punishing you?

11:06.240 --> 11:07.440
As I have said before,

11:07.750 --> 11:09.080
my life and death

11:09.320 --> 11:10.520
are yours to command.

11:11.550 --> 11:12.360
So I am willing

11:13.030 --> 11:14.560
to accept this punishment.

11:17.510 --> 11:18.110
Very good.

11:19.630 --> 11:20.630
Come and serve me.

11:55.600 --> 11:56.460
Steward Cheng,

11:56.870 --> 11:58.030
what kind of treasures could possibly

11:58.030 --> 11:59.290
win Miss Rong's favor?

12:03.870 --> 12:05.530
Sorry that I spoke out of turn.

13:03.760 --> 13:04.360
Miss Rong.

13:41.510 --> 13:42.840
-Miss Rong.
-Miss Rong.

13:48.940 --> 13:49.540
Miss Rong.

13:52.270 --> 13:54.330
Where is your Chinese New Year pouch?

13:55.480 --> 13:56.590
It's been so busy in the household lately.

13:56.590 --> 13:58.190
I forgot to go and collect it.

14:17.360 --> 14:18.220
Steward Cheng.

14:19.080 --> 14:19.680
What is it?

14:20.030 --> 14:21.120
Lady Rong has sent a message.

14:21.120 --> 14:22.390
Tomorrow at 5 AM,

14:22.480 --> 14:25.140
you need to go to the main gate
to welcome Mr. Yan.

14:30.020 --> 14:30.610
Got it.

14:31.750 --> 14:32.270
Yes.

14:43.320 --> 14:44.790
Mr. Yan, you've finally arrived.

14:44.790 --> 14:46.080
Lady Rong has been eagerly awaiting you.

14:46.080 --> 14:47.670
She has been talking about you for days.

14:47.670 --> 14:48.320
Earlier,

14:48.320 --> 14:51.120
she even wanted Miss Rong
to welcome you in person.

14:54.980 --> 14:57.750
[Yan Bailou]

15:09.030 --> 15:10.270
We ran into a landslide
on the mountain road,

15:10.270 --> 15:11.510
which delayed our journey
for several days.

15:11.510 --> 15:13.320
I'm truly sorry
for having made Lady Rong worried.

15:13.320 --> 15:16.650
I hope this hasn't disrupted any affairs
in your household.

15:16.950 --> 15:18.150
Mr. Yan, don't worry.

15:18.320 --> 15:21.120
Other young masters
have only been here for 5 days.

15:22.750 --> 15:24.810
Please come with me into the mansion.

15:26.570 --> 15:34.860
[Rong Mansion]

15:38.270 --> 15:39.030
This is...

15:40.080 --> 15:41.880
It's from the Fourth Young Lady.

15:50.870 --> 15:52.790
Please thank the Fourth Young Lady for me.

15:52.790 --> 15:54.050
I'll take my leave now.

15:59.480 --> 16:01.190
This is also from the Fourth Young Lady?

16:01.190 --> 16:01.740
Mr. Bai,

16:01.860 --> 16:03.450
Xiuqiong from Qilan Garden

16:03.480 --> 16:05.010
personally sent this over.

16:10.980 --> 16:12.910
Miss Rong sent me a martial outfit.

16:13.300 --> 16:15.770
Could it be that the next contest is...

16:19.510 --> 16:21.360
Mr. Yang, what are you doing?

16:26.030 --> 16:26.960
Miss Rong, yesterday

16:26.960 --> 16:28.600
you didn't choose anyone to dine with you.

16:28.600 --> 16:30.150
I suppose you, having seen a lot,

16:30.150 --> 16:31.960
wouldn't settle for those trivial things.

16:31.960 --> 16:33.910
I just want to ask one last question.

16:33.910 --> 16:35.360
If I win tomorrow,

16:36.390 --> 16:37.510
will you choose me?

16:38.730 --> 16:40.530
We'll talk about it when you win.

16:45.390 --> 16:46.320
I will win!

16:47.060 --> 16:47.910
Because no one

16:47.910 --> 16:49.440
deserves you more than I do!

17:44.200 --> 17:44.880
Bao,

17:45.270 --> 17:46.270
you must remember

17:46.960 --> 17:48.040
that you share

17:48.110 --> 17:50.550
the same ancestral roots
in the Rong family.

17:50.550 --> 17:51.590
A good marriage

17:51.880 --> 17:53.740
can help the Rong family flourish

17:53.840 --> 17:55.040
and prosper forever.

17:55.840 --> 17:58.770
But you're not the only granddaughter
in our family.

17:59.110 --> 18:00.710
If you don't care about this,

18:00.720 --> 18:02.850
there will always be someone who does.

18:03.750 --> 18:07.240
Don't make me worry about you.

18:12.150 --> 18:13.410
What's the fuss about?

18:13.510 --> 18:14.550
It's just a man.

18:14.570 --> 18:15.790
Just pick one who's easy on the eye

18:15.790 --> 18:16.730
and get to know him gradually.

18:16.730 --> 18:18.140
Time will tell

18:18.170 --> 18:20.100
whether he's truly to your liking.

18:22.270 --> 18:24.350
There are so many young masters today.

18:24.350 --> 18:25.550
Which one do you like?

18:26.680 --> 18:28.410
I'll tell Grandmother for you.

18:34.480 --> 18:35.550
The Rong ancestors

18:35.850 --> 18:38.510
established the tea trade
against insurmountable odds

18:38.510 --> 18:40.640
They traversed treacherous waters,
scaled precipitous peaks,

18:40.640 --> 18:43.310
crossed barren deserts
and fought fierce bandits.

18:43.310 --> 18:45.830
A single misstep
would have meant utter destruction.

18:45.830 --> 18:47.030
Without any courage,

18:47.510 --> 18:49.960
how could one be worthy of becoming
the Rong family's son-in-law?

18:49.960 --> 18:51.270
Whoever is the first
to climb to the hanging bridge

18:51.270 --> 18:52.330
and seize the prize

18:52.960 --> 18:55.080
will be the winner in the martial contest.

18:55.080 --> 18:57.830
Those who fall off the bridge
will be eliminated on the spot.

18:57.830 --> 18:58.690
Young Masters,

18:59.640 --> 19:00.700
please be careful.

19:01.510 --> 19:03.110
The bridge pier is so narrow.

19:03.270 --> 19:05.000
It can't accommodate all of us.

19:05.240 --> 19:07.500
I suppose many will be forced to withdraw

19:07.750 --> 19:09.410
before even reaching the top.

19:09.960 --> 19:11.560
Even if one climbs to the top,

19:12.880 --> 19:14.210
there's only one prize.

19:15.400 --> 19:17.200
I will definitely be the winner.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.980
Mr. Wen, I don't want to be the winner.

19:20.250 --> 19:21.580
I just want to stay safe.

19:21.600 --> 19:23.200
Please show some mercy to me.

19:24.060 --> 19:24.790
Don't worry.

19:29.680 --> 19:31.280
The martial contest begins!

19:46.350 --> 19:47.400
Why haven't they started yet?

19:47.400 --> 19:48.920
-What's going on?
-Exactly.

19:48.920 --> 19:50.320
Planning before acting.

20:10.530 --> 20:11.340
You coward!

20:12.880 --> 20:14.140
The faster they climb,

20:14.140 --> 20:15.800
the more quickly they'll die.

20:26.440 --> 20:27.860
This is the allure of the Rong family.

20:27.860 --> 20:29.990
Look how fiercely they're competing.

20:30.590 --> 20:32.510
Sometimes I truly resent my mother

20:32.510 --> 20:34.720
for insisting on marrying
into another family.

20:34.720 --> 20:35.830
She never stopped to think

20:35.830 --> 20:37.210
that a husband's heart might stray,

20:37.210 --> 20:38.540
and an in-law's face might turn cold.

20:38.540 --> 20:39.920
Once she left the Rong family,

20:39.920 --> 20:40.550
she became

20:40.550 --> 20:41.920
just another bargaining chip
weighed by others.

20:41.920 --> 20:42.720
And because of her choice,

20:42.720 --> 20:43.750
now I am an outsider too.

20:43.750 --> 20:46.350
After all, my surname is different
from yours.

20:46.630 --> 20:48.360
We share the same grandmother.

20:48.850 --> 20:50.310
Whatever your surname is,

20:51.240 --> 20:52.570
you're still my cousin.

20:55.000 --> 20:56.030
Take my advice.

20:56.640 --> 20:58.510
If you don’t want to go through
with the wedding rituals,

20:58.510 --> 21:00.840
just take someone in as a companion first.

21:01.240 --> 21:02.590
What matters is the Tea Bone.

21:02.590 --> 21:04.450
Don't let others get ahead of you.

21:04.840 --> 21:05.550
Look there.

21:27.030 --> 21:27.690
Yunxi,

21:28.680 --> 21:30.610
who do you think will be the winner?

21:31.830 --> 21:33.110
The final winner

21:35.020 --> 21:36.910
will become Shanbao's husband.

21:37.830 --> 21:38.920
Grandmother truly

21:39.440 --> 21:41.440
has a unique way of choosing people.

21:47.590 --> 21:48.310
Yang!

21:48.440 --> 21:49.570
You're despicable!

21:56.830 --> 21:57.830
Great!

21:58.960 --> 22:00.960
Mr. Yang is truly brave and valiant.

22:01.160 --> 22:02.630
I see no need to continue this contest.

22:02.630 --> 22:04.130
Shanbao, if you're to choose a husband,

22:04.130 --> 22:05.510
who else could it be but him?

22:05.510 --> 22:08.550
Mr. Yang has such a commanding presence

22:08.920 --> 22:10.380
and exceptional courage.

22:11.390 --> 22:12.790
He is truly worthy of you.

22:15.200 --> 22:16.680
Shanbao, he's not worthy.

22:18.690 --> 22:19.340
No rush.

22:24.440 --> 22:26.040
Shanbao, I made it to the top.

22:33.310 --> 22:34.710
Wen Can seems a bit off.

22:36.330 --> 22:36.920
You!

22:39.900 --> 22:40.630
Here you are.

22:40.760 --> 22:42.000
Come on, have some water.

22:42.000 --> 22:42.590
Mr. Wen.

22:46.270 --> 22:46.870
Thank you.

23:35.030 --> 23:36.350
The first half ends here.

23:36.350 --> 23:36.830
You!

23:37.440 --> 23:39.040
Stop right there, all of you!

23:43.110 --> 23:44.720
Our Rong family made it clear
from the beginning

23:44.720 --> 23:46.450
that this contest is only
for testing martial skills,

23:46.450 --> 23:48.110
not for fighting to the death.

23:48.310 --> 23:50.110
Young Masters, you must know when to stop.

23:50.110 --> 23:51.570
Whoever disobeys my order

23:51.720 --> 23:53.450
shall also step down and concede defeat.

23:53.450 --> 23:55.590
What's the fun in fighting bare-handed?

23:55.590 --> 23:56.590
Miss Rong has said

23:57.270 --> 23:58.350
that those who made it to the bridge pier

23:58.350 --> 23:59.960
may all enter the second half.

23:59.960 --> 24:01.740
Each of you can select a weapon
of your choice

24:01.740 --> 24:03.670
to make the contest more exciting.

24:35.660 --> 24:38.440
Among all the food and drink
Mr. Wen consumed today,

24:38.440 --> 24:40.840
only the tea was taken
outside the mansion.

24:56.570 --> 24:57.240
Mr. Wen,

24:57.790 --> 24:59.390
let me help you get some rest.

24:59.680 --> 25:00.810
I don't want to rest.

25:09.070 --> 25:09.800
Despicable.

25:19.510 --> 25:20.120
Miss Rong.

25:20.830 --> 25:21.790
Mr. Wen's tea

25:21.790 --> 25:23.120
has been tampered with.

25:23.910 --> 25:25.030
No need to help me up.

25:25.030 --> 25:27.290
I can still keep fighting in the contest.

25:32.150 --> 25:32.960
I have a plan.

25:38.830 --> 25:39.480
Mr. Wen,

25:40.000 --> 25:41.550
Miss Rong noticed you're unwell.

25:41.550 --> 25:42.830
She told me to take you
to get your medicine first.

25:42.830 --> 25:44.760
Then you can continue the contest.

25:44.960 --> 25:45.690
Come with me.

25:50.640 --> 25:52.770
The useless one gets all the sympathy.

25:53.790 --> 25:56.050
They even suspended the contest for him.

25:56.700 --> 25:57.660
That Wen guy

25:59.140 --> 26:00.200
is truly annoying.

26:01.920 --> 26:03.980
We'll see if he even lives long enough

26:04.160 --> 26:05.290
to make it to the end.

26:15.020 --> 26:15.590
Mr. Wen.

26:15.640 --> 26:16.750
Where are we going to get the medicine?

26:16.750 --> 26:18.240
Mr. Wen, let me take a look.

26:23.270 --> 26:25.660
You've been drugged,
so you are weak and exhausted.

26:25.660 --> 26:26.820
Miss Rong asked me to persuade you

26:26.820 --> 26:28.150
not to compete anymore.

26:28.750 --> 26:30.280
It's none of your business.

26:31.240 --> 26:33.370
You must go, even if it costs your life?

26:33.760 --> 26:35.680
Yes, I must go.

26:37.340 --> 26:37.940
Miss Rong?

26:42.930 --> 26:43.570
I'm sorry.

26:59.120 --> 27:00.770
Mr. Wen, you're so delicate.

27:01.350 --> 27:02.750
After a little head injury,

27:02.750 --> 27:03.270
you're armored

27:03.270 --> 27:04.480
from head to toe.

27:05.070 --> 27:06.320
If you're that scared,

27:06.320 --> 27:06.960
why not go back home

27:06.960 --> 27:08.020
and never come out?

27:08.680 --> 27:10.680
I'll knock that shell right off you!

27:13.030 --> 27:14.470
If he's so scared,

27:14.970 --> 27:16.570
he should just withdraw from the contest.

27:16.570 --> 27:19.090
Exactly. What a disgrace.

27:24.890 --> 27:26.220
Only these two are left.

27:29.470 --> 27:30.030
Take it.

27:36.200 --> 27:37.400
So she recognized me.

27:42.850 --> 27:44.270
What's all this?

27:45.110 --> 27:46.040
How nauseating.

27:46.670 --> 27:48.330
If she just favors her cousin,

27:48.400 --> 27:50.240
what's the point of us competing at all?

27:50.240 --> 27:52.030
Isn't this just making a fool of us?

27:52.030 --> 27:53.830
Miss Rong, you're showing such favoritism,

27:53.830 --> 27:55.640
treating your cousin better than others.

27:55.640 --> 27:57.160
It'll be hard to convince everyone.

27:57.160 --> 27:57.690
Exactly!

27:58.160 --> 27:59.640
Miss Rong, you're unfair.

27:59.830 --> 28:01.360
Unfair! We won't accept it!

28:01.550 --> 28:02.920
We fight with all our might,

28:02.920 --> 28:04.240
while your Rong family
is making a fool of us.

28:04.240 --> 28:06.110
-Exactly! It's unfair!
-Exactly!

28:06.110 --> 28:07.840
Someone tampered with his tea.

28:08.200 --> 28:10.310
The truth will be revealed
upon examination.

28:10.310 --> 28:10.960
Now,

28:11.560 --> 28:13.420
does anyone still say I'm unfair?

28:15.510 --> 28:16.440
Let's start now.

28:17.030 --> 28:18.490
Don't waste any more time.

28:36.630 --> 28:37.960
The contest continues.

29:01.470 --> 29:02.470
Aren't you going?

29:09.390 --> 29:10.790
I wouldn't dare go first.

29:11.350 --> 29:12.110
After you.

29:22.100 --> 29:23.510
Don't let go!

29:59.600 --> 30:00.560
Mr. Bai. Mr. Bai.

30:03.840 --> 30:05.440
He just passed out like that?

30:13.420 --> 30:14.390
My legs...

30:15.390 --> 30:16.420
Yang Dingchen!

30:40.290 --> 30:42.090
Good! Well done!

30:42.880 --> 30:44.030
Shanbao, look!

30:57.070 --> 30:58.800
If you all help me get the prize,

30:59.070 --> 31:01.400
our He family will reward you handsomely.

31:46.160 --> 31:48.890
Don't let him reap the benefits
from our rivalry.

33:22.000 --> 33:23.330
Who actually won, then?

33:24.160 --> 33:25.160
Well,

33:27.360 --> 33:28.880
who should be the winner?

33:36.770 --> 33:37.590
Miss Rong.

33:43.510 --> 33:44.110
Yes.

33:46.870 --> 33:48.070
The prize has been claimed.

33:48.070 --> 33:49.400
The martial contest ends here.

33:49.400 --> 33:50.510
Young Masters, please await

33:50.510 --> 33:52.240
the next round of competition.

33:52.510 --> 33:53.960
You may go back to rest for now.

33:53.960 --> 33:56.310
[Xinfang Pavilion]

34:19.440 --> 34:20.040
Come in.

34:32.070 --> 34:33.679
Miss Rong ordered me to bring

34:33.719 --> 34:36.449
Mr. Zhao here today
for a follow-up examination.

34:36.920 --> 34:38.170
Please send my thanks to Miss Rong.

34:38.170 --> 34:39.050
I'm fine.

34:40.630 --> 34:41.630
Miss Rong has said

34:41.800 --> 34:43.440
that his old injuries
are not yet resolved,

34:43.440 --> 34:44.909
and today he has got new wounds.

34:44.909 --> 34:45.880
Mr. Zhao, please

34:45.880 --> 34:47.290
conduct a thorough examination today.

34:47.290 --> 34:48.440
If you need any medicinal herbs,

34:48.440 --> 34:49.370
just let me know.

34:49.710 --> 34:50.190
Yes.

34:50.550 --> 34:52.679
I dare not disobey Miss Rong's orders.

35:07.230 --> 35:08.310
Greetings, Mr. Wen.

35:08.310 --> 35:09.510
Please wait a moment.

35:10.460 --> 35:12.070
Take my protective armor

35:12.070 --> 35:13.380
and put it away carefully.

35:13.380 --> 35:14.410
Place it right in the middle

35:14.410 --> 35:16.470
of that cabinet and lock it securely.

35:16.550 --> 35:17.030
Yes.

35:20.000 --> 35:21.630
Shanbao was worried that Yang Dingchen

35:21.630 --> 35:23.320
would hold a grudge and get back at me.

35:23.320 --> 35:25.920
She personally sent this armor
to keep me safe.

35:27.400 --> 35:28.460
Miss Rong was here?

35:28.670 --> 35:30.020
She left only a moment ago.

35:30.020 --> 35:31.350
Shanbao is being overly cautious.

35:31.350 --> 35:33.130
This is the Rong Mansion, after all.

35:33.130 --> 35:34.320
I doubt Yang Dingchen

35:34.320 --> 35:36.110
has the gall to pick a fight here.

35:36.110 --> 35:37.230
If he killed me,

35:37.510 --> 35:40.170
he'd be expelled
from the Rong Mansion for good.

35:41.280 --> 35:42.190
It's securely locked?

35:42.190 --> 35:43.000
You may go now.

35:43.240 --> 35:43.760
Yes.

35:47.930 --> 35:49.110
No wonder someone is trying

35:49.110 --> 35:50.630
to get rid of you at every turn.

35:50.630 --> 35:51.360
It must be because Miss Rong

35:51.360 --> 35:53.080
shows you extraordinary kindness,

35:53.080 --> 35:54.640
far beyond what she extends to others.

35:54.640 --> 35:56.110
We grew up together.

35:56.400 --> 35:58.930
Naturally, our bond
is unlike anyone else's.

36:01.590 --> 36:02.400
Miss Rong,

36:02.920 --> 36:04.760
you're showing too much favoritism.

36:04.760 --> 36:06.820
I invited you here today
to thank you.

36:07.190 --> 36:08.840
Shanbao told me what happened.

36:08.840 --> 36:10.230
I was rude to you at the contest arena.

36:10.230 --> 36:11.630
I hope you can forgive me.

36:12.440 --> 36:13.590
You're too kind, Young Master.

36:13.590 --> 36:14.760
I know my place.

36:15.410 --> 36:17.010
I don't deserve such thanks.

36:18.200 --> 36:20.130
I know Shanbao cares for me deeply.

36:20.550 --> 36:21.810
She seems cold-faced,

36:21.960 --> 36:23.360
but she's soft-hearted.

36:23.880 --> 36:25.730
It's my own fault
for being incompetent in martial arts

36:25.730 --> 36:27.390
and making her worry about me.

36:27.960 --> 36:29.550
Since Shanbao has put her trust in you,

36:29.550 --> 36:30.590
then I will trust you too.

36:30.590 --> 36:32.140
I hope you can help me.

36:32.360 --> 36:34.760
I will surely repay your kindness
in the future.

36:34.760 --> 36:35.910
I will spare no effort

36:35.910 --> 36:37.640
to live up to Miss Rong's trust.

36:39.880 --> 36:40.480
We all

36:40.480 --> 36:42.290
fought tooth and nail to get here.

36:42.290 --> 36:43.750
What makes him so special?

36:44.610 --> 36:45.810
Let's go check it out.

36:48.440 --> 36:49.670
Everyone, please calm down

36:49.670 --> 36:50.670
and hear me out.

36:50.690 --> 36:52.550
-We won't listen!
-We won't listen!

36:52.550 --> 36:53.150
What's the point of listening?

36:53.150 --> 36:53.510
We all

36:53.510 --> 36:54.710
fought tooth and nail to get here.

36:54.710 --> 36:55.190
This is unfair.

36:55.190 --> 36:55.480
Exactly!

36:55.480 --> 36:56.760
What has he done to deserve it?

36:56.760 --> 36:57.510
How is that even fair?

36:57.510 --> 36:58.590
Since he got here,

36:58.590 --> 36:59.840
he has never shown his face.

36:59.840 --> 37:01.000
If he's not guilty,

37:01.210 --> 37:02.440
why is he hiding?

37:02.510 --> 37:03.510
Ask him to come out!

37:03.510 --> 37:04.030
Let him confront us face to face!

37:04.030 --> 37:06.090
What dirty tricks is he up to in there?

37:06.220 --> 37:06.900
Mr. Bai,

37:07.480 --> 37:08.810
what's happening here?

37:09.910 --> 37:11.540
It's all about Mr. Yan.

37:12.350 --> 37:14.110
He didn't take part
in the martial contest,

37:14.110 --> 37:16.030
and everyone is seething with resentment.

37:16.030 --> 37:16.800
It's completely unfair!

37:16.800 --> 37:17.300
Ask him to come out!

37:17.300 --> 37:19.570
We barely see him around,

37:20.360 --> 37:22.580
yet the Rong family treats him
as an honored guest.

37:22.580 --> 37:23.950
It's truly puzzling.

37:23.970 --> 37:25.890
Yan? His surname is Yan?

37:27.570 --> 37:28.740
Why does

37:29.110 --> 37:30.590
this surname sound so familiar?

37:30.590 --> 37:31.920
We all proved our worth
with our abilities, right?

37:31.920 --> 37:32.280
Exactly!

37:32.280 --> 37:33.030
He didn't even take part
in the martial contest.

37:33.030 --> 37:34.960
There's such a commotion outside,

37:35.130 --> 37:37.390
yet the man inside remains undisturbed.

37:37.920 --> 37:39.200
How extraordinary.

37:39.630 --> 37:40.840
How is that even fair?

37:41.280 --> 37:42.360
We'll wait right here.

37:42.360 --> 37:42.710
Shut up!

37:42.710 --> 37:44.040
Let's see if he dares...

37:44.190 --> 37:45.840
You useless cowards.

37:46.320 --> 37:48.580
Why not just go in and see for yourselves?

37:50.340 --> 37:50.900
You!

37:52.150 --> 37:52.810
Follow him.

37:52.860 --> 37:53.420
Mr. Yang.

37:54.710 --> 37:55.320
Mr. Yang.

38:05.030 --> 38:05.630
Everyone,

38:05.840 --> 38:08.100
my young master has gone to Chongxi Hall.

38:08.400 --> 38:09.330
When he returns,

38:09.360 --> 38:10.510
I will inform him.

38:11.170 --> 38:13.380
Chongxi Hall? Lady Rong?

38:14.090 --> 38:14.840
Just who exactly

38:14.840 --> 38:16.000
is this Mr. Yan?

39:00.150 --> 39:01.760
Since Master Chanhui

39:02.340 --> 39:04.200
created the 18 Dragon Movements,

39:04.920 --> 39:06.000
for a hundred years,

39:06.000 --> 39:07.710
they have only been performed

39:07.710 --> 39:09.670
at the Tea Ceremony
at Ganlu Temple on Mount Meng.

39:09.670 --> 39:11.230
I never thought that today

39:11.230 --> 39:12.960
I would witness it personally.

39:13.030 --> 39:14.880
This is all thanks to you.

39:15.710 --> 39:17.170
Lady Rong, you flatter me.

39:18.000 --> 39:19.800
Since childhood, I've made a vow

39:20.050 --> 39:22.090
to serve Tea Master Wu on Mount Meng

39:23.000 --> 39:25.130
and follow his path of helping people,

39:25.320 --> 39:27.740
clearing barren hills,
building tea plantations,

39:27.740 --> 39:29.600
and benefiting the local people.

39:30.070 --> 39:31.390
I learned the 18 Dragon Movements

39:31.390 --> 39:32.620
during my practice

39:32.670 --> 39:35.000
from my fellow disciples at Ganlu Temple.

39:35.410 --> 39:37.070
Monks do not hoard their knowledge.

39:37.070 --> 39:38.510
Lady Rong, if you like them,

39:38.510 --> 39:40.370
you can send people to learn them.

39:56.000 --> 39:57.440
The Ganlu Tea today

39:57.550 --> 39:59.000
has such a translucent hue,

39:59.000 --> 40:00.600
and a richer chestnut aroma.

40:01.440 --> 40:03.040
There is a 300-year-old well

40:03.550 --> 40:05.920
in the backyard
of the temple where I practiced.

40:05.920 --> 40:06.880
It's always covered with

40:06.880 --> 40:07.940
a heavy stone slab.

40:08.070 --> 40:09.730
The slab is covered with moss.

40:10.150 --> 40:11.550
For some unknown reason,

40:11.630 --> 40:13.590
it rains whenever the slab is lifted,

40:13.590 --> 40:15.230
and the rain stops
when the slab is replaced.

40:15.230 --> 40:16.890
This attracts many visitors.

40:17.190 --> 40:18.190
When the tea

40:18.190 --> 40:20.110
is brewed with water from this well,

40:20.110 --> 40:22.570
the tea will be
more fragrant and flavorful.

40:27.550 --> 40:28.190
Bao,

40:29.850 --> 40:32.680
it's a real privilege
that Mr. Yan is willing to teach you.

40:32.680 --> 40:34.430
You must learn attentively.

40:35.680 --> 40:36.240
Yes.

41:11.750 --> 41:14.660
Do you think Mr. Yan resembles him?

41:18.670 --> 41:19.630
Not really.

41:22.930 --> 41:24.330
That's what I think too.

41:27.070 --> 41:28.030
But Mr. Yan is

41:28.030 --> 41:29.560
a well-mannered young man.

41:31.430 --> 41:32.500
It's fine

41:34.340 --> 41:35.670
that they're not alike.

41:39.030 --> 41:41.030
Mr. Yan, you're truly selfless,

41:41.030 --> 41:42.630
sharing all your knowledge.

41:42.630 --> 41:43.920
However, here in Linji,

41:43.920 --> 41:46.050
we lack that well with its sweet water,

41:46.500 --> 41:47.900
so we probably can't make

41:48.030 --> 41:49.760
such uniquely flavored tea.

41:52.210 --> 41:53.870
Why are you laughing, Mr. Yan?

41:54.840 --> 41:56.170
I'm laughing at myself.

41:59.150 --> 41:59.800
I was

42:00.470 --> 42:01.110
supposed to take my vows

42:01.110 --> 42:02.440
and become a monk today.

42:08.840 --> 42:09.800
My father sent men to cut off

42:09.800 --> 42:11.730
all food supplies to the mountain.

42:12.150 --> 42:13.350
If I hadn't come down,

42:13.820 --> 42:14.630
he would have starved

42:14.630 --> 42:16.630
all the monks in the temple to death.

42:17.480 --> 42:19.590
I'm sorry. I had no idea...

42:19.590 --> 42:20.520
I truly believed

42:21.260 --> 42:23.390
my devotion to Buddha was unshakable.

42:24.190 --> 42:26.190
So before coming here, I told myself

42:26.440 --> 42:28.240
that if the Rong family forced me

42:29.000 --> 42:30.600
to marry you against my will,

42:30.760 --> 42:32.070
I would rather die

42:33.030 --> 42:34.690
than ruin years of my practice

42:35.180 --> 42:36.190
and break the vows

42:36.190 --> 42:37.390
I made before Buddha.

42:45.610 --> 42:47.810
But upon seeing you, I finally realized

42:49.110 --> 42:50.230
that I am just

42:50.230 --> 42:51.190
a very ordinary

42:52.190 --> 42:53.400
man in this world,

42:54.440 --> 42:55.030
so I cannot

42:55.030 --> 42:56.960
continue serving Buddha anymore.

42:59.590 --> 43:02.070
What have you done wrong, Mr. Yan?

43:06.500 --> 43:09.030
I see the prayer flags fluttering
in the wind.

43:09.480 --> 43:11.340
But it is not the fault of the wind,

43:11.550 --> 43:13.280
nor is it the fault of the flags.

43:14.070 --> 43:15.030
All the fault

43:17.840 --> 43:18.970
lies within myself.

43:46.270 --> 43:47.350
Mr. Yan

43:48.630 --> 43:50.150
is truly like an unsolvable puzzle.
